WEBVTT

00:02.090 --> 00:04.650
<i>What do you mean?!</i>

00:04.650 --> 00:06.360
<i>What truth about His Majesty?!</i>

00:06.800 --> 00:10.600
I lack conclusive evidence.

00:10.600 --> 00:14.940
Thus, I desire your cooperation.

00:14.940 --> 00:17.030
My cooperation?

00:17.400 --> 00:20.250
For some time now, I have occasionally felt

00:20.250 --> 00:24.940
that the king is concealing 
a great secret from us.

00:25.540 --> 00:29.460
<i>Impossible. I could never trust 
Set more than His Majesty.</i>

00:30.280 --> 00:31.210
<i>And yet...</i>

00:31.770 --> 00:36.970
<i></i>You<i> should know the truth about the king.</i>

02:07.980 --> 02:12.980
Peace and a Secret Revealed

02:15.660 --> 02:18.140
Well done, Sariphi.

02:18.570 --> 02:20.010
Ocelot!

02:20.010 --> 02:21.230
Ocelot?

02:22.050 --> 02:23.750
Wh-What are <i>you</i> doing here?

02:24.310 --> 02:25.560
Asya...

02:28.810 --> 02:30.440
Were you always this short?

02:30.440 --> 02:32.720
You just got tall!

02:32.720 --> 02:37.010
What did you expect after more 
than a decade, you big oaf?

02:37.870 --> 02:39.760
You two know each other?

02:42.480 --> 02:46.880
Actually, Sariphi, I'm from 
the same village as Asya.

02:46.880 --> 02:47.980
What?!

02:47.980 --> 02:50.090
You up and left out of the blue, though.

02:51.320 --> 02:52.800
Because of me.

02:53.930 --> 02:59.030
You're wrong, Asya. 
I came here of my own free will.

02:59.030 --> 03:00.950
I felt that I needed to get stronger.

03:01.430 --> 03:02.110
What?

03:02.530 --> 03:05.690
I always meant to come back for you someday.

03:06.130 --> 03:08.500
Then Sariphi turned up.

03:09.060 --> 03:12.510
When I told her about you, 
she was eager for a meeting.

03:12.510 --> 03:16.680
So I thought I'd get her to fetch you,

03:17.030 --> 03:20.830
since I felt sure that she wouldn't 
view you with suspicion.

03:22.430 --> 03:24.720
You did?

03:24.720 --> 03:27.390
I've gotten stronger, Asya.

03:27.790 --> 03:31.480
I practiced swordsmanship and riding, 
and I improved myself.

03:31.480 --> 03:34.850
I know that I can protect you now!

03:35.400 --> 03:38.750
What do you think? 
How do I look in your eyes?

03:40.260 --> 03:42.020
The same as ever.

03:44.210 --> 03:47.020
So what do you want me to do?

03:55.300 --> 03:56.540
It's done.

03:57.230 --> 03:58.400
Will this do?

03:58.400 --> 04:00.120
Yes, thank you.

04:00.470 --> 04:02.460
I'll show this to His Majesty at once.

04:04.000 --> 04:06.260
Both of you, wait here.

04:06.260 --> 04:09.190
You'll see His Majesty as soon 
as he grants an audience.

04:16.460 --> 04:19.350
Meeting the king makes you nervous, too?

04:20.290 --> 04:22.320
Yes, sort of.

04:22.320 --> 04:27.790
Oh, I guess you <i>are</i> about to meet 
the jerk who made you a sacrifice.

04:27.790 --> 04:30.310
I don't hold it against him, really.

04:30.310 --> 04:31.590
You're too softhearted.

04:31.870 --> 04:35.520
I'd get back at him, 
even if it got me executed.

04:36.480 --> 04:37.530
What?

04:37.970 --> 04:39.360
I mean it.

04:39.360 --> 04:44.260
I'd punch out a king or even a god if I had to.

04:44.730 --> 04:48.490
So go in there and say your piece 
with your head held high.

04:49.460 --> 04:50.840
Thank you.

04:57.320 --> 05:01.860
<i>I don't remember much about the days</i>

05:01.860 --> 05:06.490
<i>between the night I learned I was 
a sacrifice and when I accepted it.</i>

05:07.170 --> 05:12.110
<i>But until I resigned myself to 
everything, he did frighten me.</i>

05:13.770 --> 05:17.840
<i>And now I'm about to be face-to-face 
with him, the ruler of Yoana.</i>

05:23.470 --> 05:28.100
You are the Ozmargan emissary, 
Sariphi Kleinoel,

05:28.450 --> 05:31.560
the sacrifice who was spared?

05:32.370 --> 05:33.190
I am.

05:33.590 --> 05:40.390
We have seen your document, and it does 
indeed bear the royal seal of Ozmargo.

05:40.390 --> 05:44.780
Thus, we acknowledge it 
as a genuine royal letter.

05:45.760 --> 05:50.400
Its import, however, is far too great

05:50.400 --> 05:54.590
for our kingdom to weigh its truth 
or issue a response alone.

05:55.470 --> 05:59.660
We shall convene a global 
council within seven days

05:59.660 --> 06:02.520
and confer with representatives 
of other nations.

06:02.970 --> 06:09.100
Kindly inform the king of Ozmargo 
that we wish for more time.

06:09.580 --> 06:12.840
I understand, sire. 
I promise to inform His Majesty.

06:13.580 --> 06:16.910
Incidentally, we have one 
other question for you.

06:18.200 --> 06:22.450
What sort of place is the realm of beasts?

06:22.830 --> 06:23.900
Huh?

06:24.590 --> 06:31.390
Our royal house of Maskviana accepted 
the sacrifices in exchange for peace.

06:31.390 --> 06:35.150
Since then, we have sent 
countless maidens there,

06:35.550 --> 06:42.620
forcing the weak alone to pay 
the heavy price of our respite.

06:42.920 --> 06:46.630
We have a duty to know all.

06:49.100 --> 06:53.950
The beast realm is much more 
ordinary than humans think.

06:54.640 --> 06:56.900
The environment isn't like here,

06:57.640 --> 07:03.510
but its people laugh, rejoice, waver, 
and fret over little things.

07:03.930 --> 07:07.310
Some of them are lovely, 
and some aren't so nice.

07:07.830 --> 07:14.320
And they have a kind king who wishes 
peace for beasts and humans alike.

07:15.190 --> 07:17.450
It's not some other world.

07:17.940 --> 07:22.450
Everyone there lives each 
day as best they can.

07:23.410 --> 07:25.000
It's an ordinary place,

07:25.640 --> 07:28.090
and one that means a lot to me.

07:29.790 --> 07:31.290
That's how I see it.

07:32.700 --> 07:36.530
Um... Did I say something rude?

07:36.530 --> 07:39.760
No. I was surprised that 
you were so forthright.

07:40.070 --> 07:44.980
But I'm even more shocked that His Majesty 
thought of the sacrifices that way.

07:45.260 --> 07:50.310
He's always stern in public 
and never shows weakness.

07:50.930 --> 07:54.110
<i>That... sounds like His Majesty.</i>

07:54.900 --> 07:56.750
It might take time,

07:57.140 --> 08:00.830
but it no longer seems 
impossible that someday,

08:01.620 --> 08:05.100
the human and beast realms 
will have normal relations.

08:07.780 --> 08:09.170
<i>Listen, sire.</i>

08:10.000 --> 08:13.670
<i>I managed to tell them how you feel.</i>

08:16.140 --> 08:21.440
<i>My Lord Chancellor, 
I desire only one thing of you.</i>

08:21.440 --> 08:26.740
<i>I will outline a proposal. 
Kindly convey it to the king</i>

08:27.130 --> 08:30.280
without mentioning my involvement.

08:41.730 --> 08:46.280
<i>Why do I hesitate? There is no need.</i>

08:46.280 --> 08:48.450
<i>He speaks nonsense.</i>

08:48.840 --> 08:51.210
<i>I am merely making certain.</i>

08:54.500 --> 08:57.650
It is Anubis. May I have a moment 
of Your Majesty's time?

08:59.660 --> 09:01.850
Not now, unless it's urgent.

09:02.200 --> 09:04.230
Or you may speak from out there.

09:04.750 --> 09:09.770
No, I would prefer to see your face. 
I require only a moment.

09:10.680 --> 09:17.230
<i>If the king firmly denies your request 
or refuses to leave his chamber,</i>

09:17.630 --> 09:21.770
then perhaps he has a reason 
to conceal himself from you.

09:22.850 --> 09:24.790
Please, sire.

09:24.790 --> 09:28.840
Please show yourself before 
your humble servant, Anubis.

09:39.500 --> 09:40.710
Sire...

09:41.120 --> 09:43.690
What is it? I'm busy.

09:43.690 --> 09:46.380
I beg your pardon, sire.

09:46.380 --> 09:49.400
I have proposals concerning 
your future course.

09:50.290 --> 09:53.750
First, about negotiations with Yoana.

09:55.310 --> 09:57.020
And then one other,

09:58.540 --> 10:00.920
about Lady Sariphi.

10:02.670 --> 10:05.170
Okay, I'll head back now.

10:05.170 --> 10:07.070
Thank you for the diary.

10:07.070 --> 10:10.280
You should just wait here until 
the council reaches a decision.

10:10.560 --> 10:13.250
You're so insensitive.

10:13.550 --> 10:16.000
She has her own life to worry about.

10:16.000 --> 10:17.510
Ow.

10:17.890 --> 10:20.760
Yes, I'm just dying to go back.

10:21.910 --> 10:23.130
Hey, Asya.

10:23.130 --> 10:23.900
Yes?

10:24.210 --> 10:28.090
I want to ask you something, 
but promise you won't get mad.

10:28.920 --> 10:32.220
I probably will, but let's hear it anyway.

10:34.030 --> 10:38.740
What made you start studying beast script?

10:40.160 --> 10:43.660
You've suffered a lot because of beasts,

10:43.660 --> 10:47.110
so why did you choose to 
get involved with them?

10:47.930 --> 10:48.990
No real reason.

10:49.560 --> 10:54.110
I just wanted to make sure of who I was.

10:55.230 --> 10:57.610
But I don't care about that anymore.

10:57.610 --> 10:58.550
Huh?

10:58.550 --> 11:02.170
I mean, no matter who I am,

11:02.170 --> 11:04.340
that idiot won't change one bit.

11:06.530 --> 11:07.740
You have a point.

11:09.910 --> 11:12.730
<i>No matter who you were born as,</i>

11:13.200 --> 11:15.650
<i>having someone who accepts you</i>

11:16.370 --> 11:20.260
<i>should be all you need to live on and smile.</i>

11:23.680 --> 11:24.520
<i>Leo,</i>

11:25.470 --> 11:28.170
<i>I want you to feel the same someday.</i>

11:29.170 --> 11:33.780
<i>You always look a little 
nervous and lonely somehow.</i>

11:34.920 --> 11:36.000
<i>But eventually...</i>

11:37.910 --> 11:41.790
Man, it looks like this'll actually work out!

11:41.790 --> 11:43.240
Way to go, girlie!

11:43.240 --> 11:45.080
Yes, but...

11:45.890 --> 11:48.920
<i>The big picture of history 
is important, of course,</i>

11:48.920 --> 11:50.930
<i>but so is this.</i>

11:51.350 --> 11:54.770
<i>If I can decipher this diary,</i>

11:54.770 --> 11:57.750
<i>I might be able to discover 
His Majesty's unknown roots.</i>

11:57.750 --> 12:01.530
<i>Or maybe even his own—</i>

12:01.530 --> 12:03.620
We're almost there, girlie!

12:05.810 --> 12:08.030
A message from the border guard!

12:08.030 --> 12:11.860
The acting queen consort 
has returned from Yoana!

12:19.050 --> 12:19.880
There!

12:20.110 --> 12:22.090
Package delivered!

12:22.700 --> 12:24.830
I'm home, Your Majesty!

12:33.290 --> 12:35.150
I'm so sorry I'm late.

12:36.070 --> 12:38.320
Did I worry you to death?

12:38.750 --> 12:39.580
Yes.

12:43.490 --> 12:44.650
Sire?

12:45.110 --> 12:46.620
Welcome home.

12:46.900 --> 12:48.450
I am delighted to see you safe,

12:48.750 --> 12:50.000
Lady Sariphi.

12:50.640 --> 12:52.010
Mr. Chancellor.

12:52.010 --> 12:54.510
Loath as I am to rush you 
so soon after your return,

12:54.510 --> 12:57.870
the royal council shall immediately convene.

12:57.870 --> 12:59.380
The council?

12:59.810 --> 13:01.280
Then I'll be in my room.

13:01.280 --> 13:01.990
No.

13:02.680 --> 13:05.170
Although I realize that you must be fatigued,

13:05.170 --> 13:08.710
I humbly request you to attend, Lady Sariphi.

13:09.890 --> 13:15.270
So they will gauge each nation's 
opinion at a global council,

13:15.270 --> 13:18.430
and they reserve their formal 
response until it concludes?

13:18.800 --> 13:19.580
Yes.

13:19.580 --> 13:22.570
That's only natural. 
This was all too sudden.

13:22.570 --> 13:27.240
Abolishing the system of 
sacrifices benefits Yoana,

13:27.240 --> 13:30.440
but when it comes to total peace, who can say?

13:30.860 --> 13:34.100
<i>I'm dying to tell His Majesty about so much.</i>

13:35.050 --> 13:37.620
<i>But I haven't read that diary yet,</i>

13:38.030 --> 13:41.460
<i>so maybe I should wait until 
I know something definite.</i>

13:41.950 --> 13:42.740
<i>Still...</i>

13:43.370 --> 13:47.220
<i>Is it my imagination, or does 
he seem different somehow?</i>

13:48.140 --> 13:55.330
These negotiations to abolish sacrifices 
and normalize relations with Yoana,

13:55.330 --> 13:59.460
as well as the acting queen 
consort's role in them,

13:59.460 --> 14:02.740
shall be proclaimed publicly 
in the near future.

14:03.200 --> 14:04.560
Does that please you, sire?

14:04.870 --> 14:05.520
Huh?

14:05.800 --> 14:08.160
Yes. You may proceed.

14:08.160 --> 14:09.080
Wait.

14:10.290 --> 14:12.410
Sire, I—

14:12.410 --> 14:17.640
If we continue to negotiate with Yoana, 
it will become known eventually.

14:18.290 --> 14:24.120
And if our relations with Yoana 
improve and the people accept that,

14:24.400 --> 14:28.570
you will certainly deserve 
credit for your achievements.

14:28.970 --> 14:30.640
So, should that happen,

14:31.530 --> 14:36.930
Lady Sariphi, I will recognize 
you as our lawful queen-to-be.

14:38.090 --> 14:39.310
What?!

14:39.310 --> 14:41.540
A-At last, Lady Sariphi will be...

14:41.540 --> 14:44.030
She'll be queen for real?!

14:44.260 --> 14:47.120
Don't get ahead of yourselves, okay?

14:47.120 --> 14:50.190
That's only if she passes this last test.

14:50.440 --> 14:56.400
And that test is successfully negotiating 
peace with Yoana, I presume?

14:56.400 --> 14:57.530
You presume right.

14:57.970 --> 15:01.790
She can't avoid this problem if she 
wants to be queen, of course,

15:01.790 --> 15:05.000
but something about this 
doesn't sit right with me.

15:05.000 --> 15:06.600
What do you mean?

15:06.950 --> 15:10.350
This is the chancellor's idea, as usual,

15:11.010 --> 15:14.300
but I doubt that guy would 
ever accept Sariphi.

15:14.710 --> 15:18.110
So would he really set this condition?

15:19.700 --> 15:24.130
I mean, it's definitely not easy, 
but it <i>is</i> possible.

15:24.550 --> 15:29.260
Maybe he plans to invalidate it on a 
technicality again, whatever happens.

15:29.260 --> 15:30.620
What?!

15:30.620 --> 15:35.230
B-But Lady Sariphi has worked 
so hard all this time.

15:35.470 --> 15:39.490
The chancellor is severe in his speech,

15:39.490 --> 15:43.240
but perhaps he has already 
accepted her in his heart.

15:43.240 --> 15:43.970
He would never.

15:43.970 --> 15:44.620
Never.

15:44.620 --> 15:45.620
No way.

15:46.960 --> 15:52.160
And I feel like something 
stinks in the palace lately.

15:53.340 --> 15:55.920
Something fishy.

15:57.350 --> 15:59.240
I just hope I'm worried for nothing.

16:02.340 --> 16:04.970
All of the messenger beasts 
dispatched throughout Ozmargo

16:05.360 --> 16:09.180
have returned to the palace 
as of this morning.

16:09.590 --> 16:13.960
Nearly the entire realm should now 
be aware of tomorrow's proclamation.

16:15.090 --> 16:19.070
The ruling classes of each land 
now know what to expect.

16:19.470 --> 16:23.310
A date for the council 
has not yet been fixed,

16:23.310 --> 16:28.090
but I would advise convening it 
not too long after the proclamation.

16:29.580 --> 16:30.730
Sire?

16:30.730 --> 16:32.800
Oh, sire!

16:33.290 --> 16:34.550
Do you have a minute?

16:34.980 --> 16:37.800
Listen, I want you to 
take me away right now!

16:38.080 --> 16:40.330
I'm <i>so</i> bored!

16:40.330 --> 16:42.800
I want to go out! 
It doesn't even matter where!

16:42.800 --> 16:44.020
Pretty please?!

16:45.190 --> 16:45.980
Can't we?

16:47.270 --> 16:50.510
Lady Sariphi, His Majesty must 
prepare for tomorrow's—

16:50.510 --> 16:51.570
Very well.

16:52.240 --> 16:53.270
Sire!

16:53.270 --> 16:56.680
With regard to the preparations, 
I've done all that I can.

16:57.610 --> 16:59.250
I won't be long.

16:59.520 --> 17:01.130
See to whatever remains.

17:02.780 --> 17:05.230
The nerve of that girl.

17:08.090 --> 17:10.910
Sorry, sire. I know that was selfish of me.

17:10.910 --> 17:15.900
No matter. You said that to bring me outside

17:16.330 --> 17:18.920
without the others guessing your motive.

17:19.240 --> 17:20.660
You knew?

17:21.100 --> 17:22.700
But your timing was perfect.

17:23.750 --> 17:29.740
I had been hoping to speak with you 
outside of the palace, as well.

17:30.020 --> 17:32.560
So something <i>is</i> worrying you, then?

17:33.210 --> 17:35.540
You haven't seemed like yourself in a while.

17:40.390 --> 17:41.510
What's wrong?

17:41.510 --> 17:43.470
Since we're already outside,

17:43.470 --> 17:45.690
we might as well take a detour.

17:48.490 --> 17:51.990
A detour? Into this pitch-dark place?

17:52.510 --> 17:55.170
I thought it might seem so to human eyes.

17:56.980 --> 17:58.720
What's down here?

17:59.250 --> 18:00.790
Look around you.

18:23.480 --> 18:25.080
Wow!

18:25.510 --> 18:29.640
The whole ceiling is glowing! 
And the walls, too!

18:29.640 --> 18:30.800
But how?

18:31.340 --> 18:36.770
The minerals found in this cave 
shine in the presence of magic.

18:37.460 --> 18:44.690
But a certain degree of power is required 
to produce such a visible reaction.

18:45.770 --> 18:48.950
The mere act of lighting up these stones

18:48.950 --> 18:52.380
was once a sign of might among beasts.

18:53.250 --> 18:56.390
Amazing. It's like a starry sky.

18:58.520 --> 19:00.690
Stars? I see.

19:01.080 --> 19:07.010
I considered this light merely a sign 
of magic, but you see it differently.

19:07.830 --> 19:11.400
In this land, stars only shine 
on nights of revelation.

19:11.400 --> 19:14.220
I can never behold it.

19:14.990 --> 19:18.700
Even on my sole visit to 
Yoana to retrieve you,

19:19.210 --> 19:24.570
I was too preoccupied with concealing 
myself to look up at the sky.

19:26.040 --> 19:29.270
Such sights are too far beyond my ken.

19:30.440 --> 19:33.270
One day, when we make peace with Yoana...

19:34.140 --> 19:38.780
When you can appear openly in any form,

19:39.220 --> 19:41.110
I know you'll be able to see them.

19:42.690 --> 19:46.800
When that happens, let's go gaze 
at a real starry sky together.

19:47.820 --> 19:48.680
Yes.

19:50.510 --> 19:54.820
Tomorrow's proclamation may 
prove a critical moment for me.

19:55.430 --> 19:59.940
Because getting people to 
accept peace won't be easy?

20:00.620 --> 20:02.320
That's part of it.

20:02.320 --> 20:09.450
But this is a wall that I must overcome 
for our—no, for my own sake.

20:09.920 --> 20:13.490
Whatever happens, I cannot back down.

20:14.570 --> 20:15.340
Okay.

20:15.910 --> 20:19.300
I'm sure they'll understand 
how you feel, sire.

20:23.660 --> 20:25.270
I promise you'll be fine.

20:25.880 --> 20:29.310
No matter what happens, 
I'll always be with you.

20:40.560 --> 20:43.260
Unsurprisingly, the people's 
eyes are on this proclamation.

20:44.140 --> 20:47.460
I suppose this calls for 
greater-than-usual caution.

20:48.030 --> 20:52.430
Although the people may not be 
the only ones I need to be wary of.

20:55.240 --> 20:59.060
I will disappear briefly during the event.

20:59.420 --> 21:02.220
But please, pay that no mind.

21:02.220 --> 21:06.340
I have no designs against the king.

21:06.960 --> 21:08.570
Not against the <i>king</i>.

21:10.660 --> 21:14.360
It is time, sire. You should go.

21:14.860 --> 21:15.850
Yes.

21:18.090 --> 21:20.040
<i>I promise you'll be fine.</i>

21:20.040 --> 21:23.310
<i>No matter what happens, 
I'll always be with you.</i>

21:34.240 --> 21:38.510
My kingdom is about to choose a new future.

21:39.000 --> 21:45.370
One in which we join hands with our 
near-yet-distant neighbor, Yoana.

21:45.760 --> 21:47.940
What? He can't be serious.

21:48.710 --> 21:53.060
Are the rumors of a human queen true, then?!

21:53.990 --> 21:56.590
I have already sent an envoy to Yoana

21:56.590 --> 22:00.740
to smooth the way for talks 
to normalize relations.

22:02.860 --> 22:08.290
All so that we can make true peace, 
not this truce in name only.

22:08.630 --> 22:13.070
And our emissary who strives 
to bridge this gap is—

22:15.340 --> 22:16.990
<i>Wh-What is this?</i>

22:18.000 --> 22:19.870
Our emissary... is...

22:20.600 --> 22:23.600
<i>Why now, of all times?!</i>

22:24.190 --> 22:27.940
our new... future que...

22:30.140 --> 22:31.150
Sire?

22:52.140 --> 22:54.440
Wh-What the?! Look at the sky!

22:54.440 --> 22:55.800
What's going on?!

22:56.790 --> 22:58.190
What's that?!

23:08.860 --> 23:14.800
<i></i>You<i> should know the truth 
about the absolute monarch</i>

23:19.170 --> 23:21.430
<i>to whom you pledged everything.</i>

23:25.690 --> 23:27.870
What did I just see?

23:27.870 --> 23:31.430
The miasma suddenly cleared, 
and His Majesty became human.

23:31.430 --> 23:33.630
But that's absurd!

23:33.630 --> 23:36.190
It's Set. This must be his scheme.

